      "summary": "Textile woven from raffia palm fibre (skirt?), made in 7 sections machine stitched together. Borders long each long side comprise narrow hand sewn raffia strips edged with red cotton cloth. Raffia strips decorated with purple-dyed; some in dark brown triangles, some printed on and some hand sewn. Border finished on one side with narrow blue/purple-dyed raffia strip with tiny decorative pompoms; on other side by wide and narrow blue/purple-dyed raffia strips edged with red cotton cloth and with edge of tiny decorative pompoms.",
